1
00:00:02,653 --> 00:00:10,627
Your account and administration. Password, data, email, and the system console

2
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:15,139
Your initials, top right, open the user menu.

3
00:00:15,248 --> 00:00:20,668
My account changes your password, downloads your data, or deletes your account.

4
00:00:20,807 --> 00:00:27,075
Email preferences turns each kind of email on or off. Changes save straight away.

5
00:00:27,216 --> 00:00:33,565
Administrators also see System console. Status shows whether reminders are being sent.

6
00:00:33,688 --> 00:00:39,828
Settings decide who can sign up, password rules, limits, and an announcement for everyone.

7
00:00:39,933 --> 00:00:48,035
Users lets you invite people, disable or unlock an account, send a password link, or view the app as that user.

8
00:00:50,243 --> 00:00:57,881
The audit log, email log and insights are in the same console. Back to GoalNexa returns to the app.
